trigger_en:
1) The controller is in a shutdown state, and there is no uncontrolled rectification state;
2) Continuously sample the U-phase current 32 times (2 ms/time) and calculate the average value, which is greater than 8.6% of the maximum Hall current value;
3) Five consecutive tests have met the conditions and 2 report zero drift faults;
1) The controller is in shutdown state and not in uncontrolled rectification state; 2) Evaluating sample the U-phase current 32 times (2 ms/time), calculate the average value, which is greater than 8.6% of the Hall maximum current value; 3) If condition 2 is met for 5 adverse tests, a zero drift fault is difficult;

