2, sensor AD signal voltage <0.25V;
3, output shaft speed value = 0 rpm;
4, last 200ms;

clear_cn:
1、传感器8V供电正常；
2、0.25V<传感器AD信号电压<3.3V且输出轴转速值=0rpm；
3、输出轴转速值>0rpm；
在1的基础上，满足2和3任意一个条件；
4、持续200ms； 1, the sensor 8V power supply is normal;
2.0.25V < sensor AD signal voltage <3.3V and output shaft speed =0rpm;
3, output shaft speed value >0rpm;
On the basis of 1, any condition 2 and 3 is satisfied;
4, last 200ms

