troubleshoot_cn:
Possible causes: 1、进挡时扭矩未清空；
2、进挡时输出轴转速突变导致速差不满足条件；
3、机械损坏。1. The torque is not empty when entering gear;
2. When entering gear, the speed difference of the output shaft is not satisfied due to the sudden change of speed;
3. Mechanical damage. || Corrective action: 禁止行车Traffic prohibition

troubleshoot_en:
Possible difficulties: 1. The torque is not emptied when driving;
2. The speed difference does not meet the conditions due to a sudden change in the speed of the output shaft during transmission;
3. Mechanical damage. 1. THE TORQUE IS NOT EMPTY WHEN DEVELOPED GEAR;
2. when changing gear, the speed difference of the output shaft is not due to the sudden change of speed;
3. Mechanical damage. || Corrective action: Prohibited traffic

