Judgment conditions: radiator fan failure:
When the VDC motor fan PWM is emitted:
① VDC detects a fan feedback fault, and the fan current not receiving SJB feedback or the current of the 3 fans receiving SJB feedback is <0.5A. AC transmission is prohibited. The radiator fan PWM output is normal, and the motor fan fault is level 2;

② VDC has detected a fan feedback fault, but the SJB feedback fan current is normal, the radiator fan's PWM output is normal, and the VDC AC compressor limits the power to 1 kW, and the motor fan fault is reported, fault level 1; (The fault or PWM will be cleared; the fault will be reported after three times, and the power up and down will be cleared)

③ VDC received feedback from SJB for 1 fan current <0.5A, VDC AC compressor limited power to 2kW, and reported motor fan failure, fault level 1;

④ VDC receives feedback from SJB that the current of the 2 fans is <0.5A, and the VDC AC compressor limits the power to 1kW, and reports a motor fan fault, fault level 1;

⑤ The VDC received feedback from SJB that the current of all 3 fans was <0.5A. The VDC transmission of AC was prohibited, and the motor fan fault was reported. The fault level is level 2.

Judgment conditions: Battery cooling fan failure:
When the VDC battery fan PWM is emitted:
① The VDC detects a battery fan feedback failure, or the fan current does not receive feedback from SJB. The compressors and fans on both sides of the battery thermal management are prohibited, and the battery fan failure is reported. When the battery thermal management is in uncooled mode, fault level 1; when in cooling mode, fault level 2;

② VDC receives feedback from SJB that the current of 1 battery fan is <0.5A. VDC limits the maximum speed of the compressors on both sides by 4000 rpm, and reports battery fan failure, fault level 1;

③ VDC received feedback from SJB that the current of the 2 battery fans on one side was <0.5A. VDC prohibited the compressors on both sides from working, and reported a battery fan failure. Fault level 2.

Judgment conditions: Battery thermal management three-way valve failure:
① VDC has not received feedback from the three-way valve. The compressor, fan and WPTC are prohibited from working, and the three-way battery valve is faulty. When the battery thermal management is in non-cooling mode, fault level 1; when in cooling or heating mode, fault level 2;

② When the three-way valve is blocked, 0x32 is generated on both sides. If there is no feedback failure, the maximum speed of the compressor on both sides is limited to 4000 rpm, the maximum power of the WPTC is 10 kW, fault level 1. If there is still fault feedback, the compressor, fan and WPTC are prohibited from working, and the battery three-way valve is reported. When the battery thermal management is in uncooled mode, fault level 1; when in cooling or heating mode, fault level 2;

③ When the three-way valve reports other faults other than blocking rotation, the compressor, fan, and WPTC are prohibited from working, and the three-way battery valve failure is reported. When the battery thermal management is not in cooling mode, fault level 1; when in cooling or heating mode, fault level 2.

Judgment conditions: Motor cooling water pump failure: When the PWM of the VDC battery pump is emitted:
① VDC detects motor cooling water pump failure or pump current without SJB feedback, reports motor pump failure, fault level 2;

② The VDC receives feedback from SJB that the current of 1 motor pump is <0.5A, reporting a motor pump fault, fault level 1;

③ The VDC received feedback from SJB that the current of the 2 motor pumps was <0.5A, and the motor pump was faulty, and the fault level was level 2. The PWM output of the water pump and radiator fan is normal in case of failure.

Judgment conditions: Battery thermal management three-way valve failure:
① VDC has not received feedback from the three-way valve. The compressor, fan and WPTC are prohibited from working, and the three-way battery valve is faulty. When the battery thermal management is in non-cooling mode, fault level 1; when in cooling or heating mode, fault level 2;

② When the three-way valve is blocked, 0x32 is generated on both sides. If there is no feedback failure, the maximum speed of the compressor on both sides is limited to 4000 rpm, the maximum power of the WPTC is 10 kW, fault level 1. If there is still fault feedback, the compressor, fan and WPTC are prohibited from working, and the battery three-way valve is reported. When the battery thermal management is in uncooled mode, fault level 1; when in cooling or heating mode, fault level 2;

③ When the three-way valve reports other faults other than blocking rotation, the compressor, fan, and WPTC are prohibited from working, and the three-way battery valve failure is reported. When the battery thermal management is not in cooling mode, fault level 1; when in cooling or heating mode, fault level 2.

Judgment conditions: After the compressor works for 2 minutes, the saturation temperature is ≤2℃, the superheat is ≤2℃, and the maximum speed of the compressor is 6000 rpm.
Superheat ≤ 1℃, maximum compressor speed 3000 rpm;
If the superheat does not increase within 20 s, the compressor reduces the speed by -400rpm/20s, and the minimum speed of the compressor is 1000 rpm,

Judgment conditions: Trigger conditions: (6s)
Adhesion detection command:
