Judgment conditions: Trigger conditions: (200ms)
(1) The main circuit is powered on and ready to be powered on;
(2) The auxiliary circuit is ready to be powered on;
(3) The charging state of the upper circuit is ready to be powered on;
(4) The BMS circuit is powered on and the main connection is closed;
(5) After the high voltage is successfully charged, the front-end voltage is less than the lower battery voltage limit - 10V, which is greater than the upper limit of the battery voltage+10V.
(6) When the high voltage is unsuccessful, the front-end voltage is less than the lower battery voltage limit.
(1) OR (2) OR (3) OR (4)) AND (5) OR (6))

Judgment conditions: Trigger conditions: (20s/40s)
 (1) The bus voltage is greater than or equal to 300V;
 (2) Effective insulation testing;
 (3) The upper axle arm sampling is 0mv, and the lower axle arm sampling is greater than (VP*2.35/762.35*0.78*100 unit mV);
 (4) The lower axle arm sampling is 0mv, and the upper axle arm sampling is greater than (VP*2.35/762.35*0.78*100 unit mV);
 (5) The upper and lower axle arm samples were 0 mV;
 (6) Occurs twice in a row;
 (7) Insulation inspection state machine U0-234 (3~7);
 (1) AND (2) AND (3) OR (4) OR (5)) AND (6) AND (7)

clear_en:
Reset conditions:
(1) The bus voltage is less than 300V;
(2) The insulation test function is not valid;
(3) The vehicle insulation value returned to normal (the upper and lower axle arm sampling voltages were non-zero);
 (1) || (2) || (3)

trigger_en:
Judgment conditions: Trigger conditions: (220ms/450ms)
(1) The bus voltage is greater than or equal to 300V;
 (2) Effective insulation testing;
 (3) The upper axle arm sampling point 1 voltage is greater than 15mV;
 (4) The voltage at the sampling point 2 of the lower axle arm is greater than 15mV;
 (5) (3) and (4) occur 2 times in a row;
 (6) Insulation inspection state machine U0-234 (10 in self-test);
 (7) Insulation inspection state machine U0-234 (1 upper and lower axle arm adhesion detection, 2 adhesion detection judgment);
 (8) (3) and (4) appear 3 times in a row;

 (1) AND (2) AND (condition 1 OR condition 2)
Condition 1: ((3) OR (4)) AND (5) AND (6)), the total duration is about 220ms;
Condition 2: ((3) OR (4)) AND (7) AND (8)), the total duration is about 450ms;

clear_en:
Reset conditions:
(1) The bus voltage is less than 300V;
(2) The insulation test is disabled;
(1) & (2)

