2. 500mv <position voltage<4500mv;
3. Continuous for 200ms;

trigger_en:
Judgment conditions: 1. The sensor's 8V power supply is normal;
2. Sensor AD signal voltage <2.5V;
3. Output shaft speed value = 0rpm;
4. Continuous for 200ms;

clear_en:
1. The sensor's 8V power supply is normal;
2. 2.5V<sensor AD signal voltage<3.3V and output shaft speed value=0rpm;
3. Output shaft speed value>0rpm;
On the basis of 1, any one of 2 and 3 conditions is satisfied;
4. Continuous for 200ms;

