(3) The slow charging contactor is closed for a period of time (350ms);
(4) The back-end voltage of the slow-charging contactor is still below a certain value (41% of the front-end voltage);
(1) AND (2) AND (3) AND (4)

Reset conditions:
(1) Faults cannot be automatically recovered.
(2) If the power is turned on again after PowerDown and the fault entry conditions are not met, the fault exits.

