Precharge timeout: After the precharge relay is closed, the closing conditions of the main relay are not met for 1.5s;
Pre-charged load short circuit: external high voltage ≤0.2*battery voltage total circuit current ≥0.8* (battery voltage pre-charge resistance value), lasts 500ms;
Pre-charge overcurrent: total circuit current ≥0.3* (battery voltage pre-charge resistance value)
Pre-detection failure: After the main circuit pre-relay is closed, the main relay closure conditions are not met for 300 ms

Precharge timeout: After the auxiliary precharge relay is closed, the auxiliary relay does not meet the closing conditions for 1.5s;
Pre-charged load short circuit: high voltage on the outside of the auxiliary circuit ≤0.2* battery voltage
Pre-test failure: After the auxiliary circuit pre-relay is closed, the auxiliary relay closing conditions are not met for 300 ms

