2. The output shaft speed sensor is fault-free;
3. The motor speed is fault-free;
4. Normal communication with the MCU;
5. Non-shift state;; threshold value: actual transmission ratio - theoretical design transmission ratio > 0ffsetHD; diagnosis time: 200ms

