Entry conditions: PowerON; 1) The controller is in a shutdown state and is not in an uncontrolled rectification state;
2) Continuously sample the U-phase current 32 times (2 ms/time) and calculate the average value, which is greater than 8.6% of the maximum Hall current value;
3) Five consecutive tests have met the conditions and 2 report zero drift faults;

